        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">A neuronal ceroid lipofuscinosis that is characterized by juvenile-onset of progressive dementia, seizures, and progressive visual failure and an ultrastructural pattern of lipopigment with a &apos;fingerprint&apos; profile and has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the CLN3 gene on chromosome 16p11.</obo:IAO_0000115>
